    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d399">

                <pb facs="0524" n="416" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg416"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ryan to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-03-22"><hi rendition="#italic">March 22, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received March 31.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1196.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to Department’s No. 908, of 10th
                    instant, relative to the imprisonment of Mr. Edward Lycan, at Guaymas, Sonora, I
                    have the honor to advise you that, in obedience thereto, I have addressed a note
                    to Mr. Mariscal, drawing his notice anew to the matter, and advising him of the
                    wishes of my Government in the premises.</p>
                <p>My No. 1188, of the 18th instant, has apprised you of the action which had
                    already been taken in the case by this legation.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomas Ryan.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d399-a1.xml" xpointer="d399-a1"/>
            </div>
